Original commit body from 44a69cee46c3d46d07232c18a59f465abce4e5f1:

Implements ADR-0004 §"Installed dependency source" (WI-bapal).

- discovery.INSTALLED_DEP_RULES: per-ecosystem {candidate name, content
  marker, package listing} registry generalising the virtualenv rule. Mix
  deps/ (mix.exs+mix.lock beside, or deps/*/hex_metadata.config),
  node_modules/ (package.json beside, or npm/yarn/pnpm state file inside),
  Composer vendor/ (composer.json + vendor/autoload.php), Go vendor/ (go.mod +
  vendor/modules.txt), Bundler vendor/bundle (Gemfile.lock), CocoaPods Pods/
  (Podfile.lock + Pods/Manifest.lock), virtualenvs. node_modules and vendor
  leave DEFAULT_EXCLUDES.
- Owner decision recorded in ADR-0004: a committed directory (non-dot entries
  in HEAD's tree, via git ls-tree; never the index) is vendored code, never
  installed; it is analysed and classified tier 3 (node_modules/ and vendor/
  below the root are now tier 3 too).
- BUILD_OUTPUT_RULES: Mix cover/, Phoenix priv/static/assets, .dart_tool,
  .stack-work, elm-stuff by content; .elixir_ls by name.
- Disclosure when something was skipped: one stderr line, one sketch
  Overview line, supply_chain_summary.installed_deps_skipped
  {dirs, packages, entries}.
- --trace-deps <pkg,...|all|none> on sketch/survey/slice and a trace_deps
  config key (ADR-0045); part of the results-cache key (-deps-all /
  -deps-<hash> state suffix). Per package, only the traced packages'
  directories inside an installed directory are analysed; traced source is
  tier 3.
- Project-manifest walks, profile/sketch manifest scans, the sketch's
  Additional Files and Structure counts never treat installed source as the
  project's (an installed deps/cowboy/mix.exs had declared the cowboy
  framework).

Evidence: Mix fixture (mix.exs, mix.lock, lib/app.ex -> Foo.greet,
deps/foo): default -> no deps/ symbols, App.hi -> Foo.greet external stub,
disclosure on stderr and in the sketch; --trace-deps foo / all -> deps/foo
symbols tier 3 and the call resolves; deps/ committed -> tier 3 by default.
